es/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqj34j7dk771o--b4c060cbae4b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqj34j7dk771o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">With immigration curbs and tech firms cutting foreign hiring, US residency is becoming a distant dream for many Indians.</summary></entry><entry><title>Why is Elon Musk plotting a mega-merger of SpaceX and Tesla?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr93z1e87e0do#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T23:04:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr93z1e87e0do--8d22fc4debd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr93z1e87e0do?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Musk says there's "a lot to be gained" by combining the firms in what would be the biggest merger in history.</summary></entry><entry><title>Websites taken down worldwide as critical cyber-security update issued</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmly0lg3w5x2o#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T19:54:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmly0lg3w5x2o--23d28394e263.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmly0lg3w5x2o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The vulnerabilities with PHP, a programming language widely used across the internet, have been described as the most significant ever found by AI.</summary></entry><entry><title>Just Eat apologises for AI food mistakes after social media ridicule</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crz981p0klvgo#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T17:04:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crz981p0klvgo--686a391ecfec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crz981p0klvgo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">A spokesperson said it was removing inaccurate AI images and pausing the rollout of the tool.</summary></entry><entry><title>Elon Musk confirms he is considering merging Tesla and SpaceX</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmlyl09xjke4o#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T08:42:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmlyl09xjke4o--3dc6f12e33fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmlyl09xjke4o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Musk says special committees within both companies have been formed to look at a possible mega-merger.</summary></entry><entry><title>The tech helping crack decades-old cold cases</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c370pzdkw77jo#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T23:13:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c370pzdkw77jo--de99a1d351f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c370pzdkw77jo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Investigative genetic genealogy can help hunt down criminals but raises worries over privacy.</summary></entry><entry><title>OpenAI CEO Sam Altman wins dismissal of sister's lawsuit</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c94g1502el58o#0</id><updated>2026-10-22T05:04:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T19:42:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c94g1502el58o--8660bcdf866d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c94g1502el58o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">A US district judge dismissed the case after Ann Altman had refused to attend an independent medical examination.</summary></ent